       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DTMF-PBX-MATRIX.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DTMF-PBX-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GOERTZEL-FILTER-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DUAL-TONE-MATRIX-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-YELLOWBOX-TRUNK-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DTMF-LATENCY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DTMF-PBX-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DTMF-PBX-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-DTM-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DTM-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GOERTZEL-AND-MATRIX.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TRUNK-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-DTM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GOERTZEL-AND-MATRIX.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GOERTZEL-FILTER-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DUAL-TONE-MATRIX-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-TRUNK-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-YELLOWBOX-TRUNK-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DTMF-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-DTM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GOERTZEL-FILTER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DUAL-TONE-MATRIX-OK = 1 AND
              WS-YELLOWBOX-TRUNK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DTMF-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DTMF-PBX-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-DTM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DTM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-DTM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DTM-CODE.
